"""Add an Android APK or saved runtime profile as a Steam non-Steam shortcut.

--google-play adds "Google Play (Lepton)" instead: Android without an APK,
opening the Play Store; games installed there keep their data in that one
shortcut's compatdata. --artwork imports user-supplied Steam library images.

Run with Steam fully exited. Uses Python's standard library only.
Refuses unknown VDF formats rather than overwriting Steam configuration.
"""
